{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rgcESyHMMuFLPQsKEjZ3Bw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.842818+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rgcESyHMMuFLPQsKEjZ3Bw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/HDxH2cGwMTUa1t72JJpGmibObmCPrnDV35TTwoZOXdaWx3a7uypianZrO22NHc8oTEHRBFAA7KA98xfJIfk7uly16s2VEK46ic7iaBdnWoDjbHU/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>清华大学航空发动机研究院（简称“清华航发院”）成立于2018年12月18日，以“瞄准航发技术创新，服务国家发展战略”为愿景，定位“基础理论，人才培养，关键技术，前沿探索”，探索我国航空发动机自主研发技术路线，力争把清华航发院建设成具有国际一流水准的航空发动机理论技术创新基地和高端人才培养基地。</span></p><p><span>现面向全国优秀高年级本科生举办清华大学航空发动机研究院“航发新星”论坛，为航发领域优秀学子搭建互动交流平台。论坛拟于2026年6月6日以线上线下结合方式举行，特别期待热爱航发的你亲临清华昌平科研基地，共探工业皇冠上的明珠之美。本次活动主要包括航空发动机发展及航发院基本情况介绍、学术讲座、开放实验室参观（仅线下）、师生互动交流等环节，帮助学生了解清华大学航发院的师资、科研和人才培养情况，接触航发相关学科研究方向和科技前沿、拓宽学术视野、了解行业发展前景。</span></p><p><span>报名申请通道从即日起开放，截止时间为2026年5月26日10:00，逾期将不予受理，具体活动安排后续另行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/HDxH2cGwMTVEibFIkMlGbjNOxiadia3AvXO2rAf1FEzXmLUYQibXGic0kMu9xF1dFB390ZIIojH5YVuLD0DCgnKLLMUlib28iaP9jnZxN8qzyZCqpc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>（1）本次论坛面向全国高校本科高年级在校生；</span></span></p><p><span>（2）对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，具有从事航空发动机相关领域研究工作的强烈意愿；</span></p><p><span>（3）学习成绩优异，具备较好的英语水平；</span></p><p><span>（4）身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）网上报名：申请人可登录如下网址完成网上报名：</span></p><p><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/QiV1cA2.aspx。</span></p><p><span>（2）材料递交：申请者将以下报名材料按照顺序扫描后合并成一个PDF文件，以“姓名+学校+专业方向研究所”格式命名，邮件主题统一为：姓名 +学校+专业方向研究所，发送至：</span></p><p><span>hfyyjsb@mailoa.tsinghua.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span>1）申请表<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rgcESyHMMuFLPQsKEjZ3Bw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">“航发新星”论坛申请表</a>；</span></p><p><span>2）个人情况介绍（1000字以内，简单介绍个人学术背景、未来的学习科研计划等，重点介绍曾经开展的研究工作。落款须签名）；</span></p><p><span>3）学业成绩单（含前五个学期各科成绩及学业排名证明，需加盖当前所在学院教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>4）相关获奖证书和英语水平证书（提交扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>5）在学术期刊上发表的文章、出版物或其他学术作品也可作为申请材料提交。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>说明：网上报名与申报材料同时提交，方视同报名成功，本次论坛活动不收取任何费用。线下参会的申请人交通费、食宿、保险费（必须购买）自理，活动当天提供中餐。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>由于名额有限，“航发新星”论坛组委会将对材料进行审查，入选者通过电子邮件通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）咨询电话：010-62771763</span></p><p><span>（2）电子邮箱：</span></p><p><span>hfyyjsb@mailoa.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>清华大学航空发动机研究方向和教师信息，可访问官网：</span></p><p><span>https://www.ae.tsinghua.edu.cn/，或关注清华大学航空发动机研究院微信公众号：清华大学航发院。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>供稿 | 人才培养办</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>编辑 </span><span><span>| 党政办</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核 </span></span><span><span>| 吴昊芳</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HDxH2cGwMTVbS4xk3ibotgXa3lK3x5CVVrficSTTB75kWTeha0r9vx6bbcooXpj9tNQnIT0XslmDlzkYiaLMHAKIMSwqYxYZDAQdIIPledNyib8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>扫二维码 | 关注我们</span></p><p><span>公众号 </span><span><span>| </span></span><span>清华大学航发院</span></p><p><span>官网 </span><span><span>| www.ae.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bf3280717919b515ebb4760866d369b8bcaa4fcdeb14aceace386e9bf6460fc8","textLength":1220,"sourceSha256":"52c6a285e991d78fa32f06466db74248f65cab52fe379289bff67731fc69b4eb","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ddfa3c2c4e2c2767b03e","title":"2026年清华大学航空发动机研究院2026年“航发新星”论坛","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.842818+00:00"}
